[8.423796, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[8.425591, "o", ".venv/bin/python trifecta.py --tools\r\n"]
[8.450364, "o", "search_emails  private data, untrusted content      inbox content is private, and anyone can write an email body\r\nsearch_files   private data, untrusted content      drive files are private; shared files can be edited by outsiders\r\nget_contact    private data                         the staff directory is internal; IT maintains it, so it is trusted\r\nsend_email     a way out                            sends any text to any address\r\nshare_file     a way out                            gives any address read access to a file\r\n"]
[8.455519, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.45567, "o", ".venv/bin/python trifecta.py\r\n"]
[8.480084, "o", "single\r\n  model (plans, reads, acts)   model  private data, untrusted content, a way out           ALL THREE in one model: the trifecta (Rule of Two broken)\r\nsingle+taint\r\n"]
[8.480202, "o", "  model, before reading data   model  private data, a way out                              2 of 3 (Rule of Two holds for this model)\r\n  model, after untrusted data  model  private data, untrusted content                      2 of 3 (Rule of Two holds for this model)\r\ndual\r\n  planner                      model  a way out                                            1 of 3 (Rule of Two holds for this model)\r\n  quarantined                  model  private data, untrusted content                      2 of 3 (Rule of Two holds for this model)\r\n  controller                   code   private data, untrusted content, a way out           code: holds the legs, follows no instructions; its rules are the boundary\r\ndual+taint\r\n  planner                      model  a way out                                            1 of 3 (Rule of Two holds for this model)\r\n  quarantined                  model  private data, untrusted content                      2 of 3 (Rule of Two holds for this model)\r\n  controller + sink policies   code   private data, untrusted content, a way out           code: holds the legs, follows no instructions; its rules are the boundary\r\n"]
